<title>USA: San Antonio, Texas, $68 mln water bonds.</title>
<headline>San Antonio, Texas, $68 mln water bonds.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney Inc said Tuesday it tentatively priced $68 million of San Antonio, Texas, water system revenue improvement and refunding bonds, Series 1996, with a top yield of 5.88 percent in 2026.</p>
<p>The bonds are MBIA insured.  </p>
<p>CITY OF SAN ANTONIO, TEXAS</p>
<p>RE: $68,000,000*</p>
<p>(BEXAR COUNTY)</p>
<p>WATER SYSTEM REVENUE IMPROVEMENT AND REFUNDING</p>
<p>BONDS, SERIES 1996</p>
<p>MOODY'S: Aaa		   S&amp;P: AAA		   FITCH: AAA</p>
<p>(A1 UNDERLYING)	  (A+ UNDERLYING)	    (A+</p>
<p>UNDERLYING)	MBIA INSURED</p>
<p>DATED: 10/15/1996	  FIRST COUPON: 05/15/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 05/15</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON	   PRICE</p>
<p>05/15/2013		3,310M    5.65  %	100.00</p>
<p>05/15/2014		3,500M    5.70  %	100.00</p>
<p>05/15/2015		3,700M    5.75  %	100.00</p>
<p>05/15/2016		3,910M    5.75  %	100.00</p>
<p>05/15/2021	     23,145M    5.625 %	  5.84</p>
<p>					     (Approx. $ Price 97.216)</p>
<p>05/15/2026	     30,435M    5.625 %	  5.88</p>
<p>					    (Approx. $ Price 96.447)</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: 05/15/2006 at 102.00, DTP 05/15/2008</p>
<p>The award is expected Thursday, October 31, 1996.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on November 19, 1996.</p>
<p>Smith Barney Inc.</p>
